---
title: Martini
servings: 1
tags: [cocktail, gin]
source: Our own
---

In a #mixing cup{}(with ice), pour @gin{2%fl_oz} and @dry vermouth{0.5%fl_oz}. Add @orange bitters{1%dash} if available. Stir well, and pour into a #coupe glass{}(well chilled). Garnish with a @lemon peel{1%twist}, twisted over the cocktail to release citrus oils.

> dry martini means less vermouth, dirty martini means add a splash of olive brine.
